WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.669 --> 00:00:16.435
Brad: I think the shrink-gun went off.

2
00:00:16.455 --> 00:00:19.157
Danny: Something definitely happened!

3
00:00:19.177 --> 00:00:21.598
Brad: I wonder if it shrunk something.

4
00:00:21.618 --> 00:00:23.419
Danny: Let's look.

5
00:00:31.123 --> 00:00:32.184
Look! It worked!

6
00:00:36.512 --> 00:00:37.853
Brad: I think you're right.

7
00:00:37.873 --> 00:00:40.095
Danny: Of course, I'm right.

8
00:00:40.816 --> 00:00:42.817
Now, let's go get those bullies!

9
00:00:42.837 --> 00:00:44.919
Brad: No, wait!

10
00:00:44.959 --> 00:00:47.902
Danny: What's the matter now, Brad?

11
00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:49.963
Brad: I think we should test it more.

12
00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.324
Danny: Why?

13
00:00:51.685 --> 00:00:52.966
The nano-putty worked.

14
00:00:53.246 --> 00:00:53.786
Let's go.

15
00:00:53.806 --> 00:00:58.830
Brad: In any science experiment, you need to test things more than once.

16
00:01:00.392 --> 00:01:01.192
Danny: Ugh!

17
00:01:01.673 --> 00:01:03.795
I didn't realize I was still in school.

18
00:01:04.495 --> 00:01:05.216
Sorry, Teacher.

19
00:01:05.964 --> 00:01:07.585
Brad: We should make sure it's safe.

20
00:01:08.326 --> 00:01:08.726
Danny: Fine.

21
00:01:08.966 --> 00:01:12.029
Brad: Let's try it on that glass of water.

22
00:01:12.049 --> 00:01:15.131
Danny: Let me do it.

23
00:01:15.812 --> 00:01:18.154
I'm the one who will use it on Chuck and Dave.

24
00:01:18.174 --> 00:01:20.075
Brad: Fine, go ahead.

25
00:01:21.196 --> 00:01:26.060
Danny: See?

26
00:01:26.380 --> 00:01:27.161
It's perfect.

27
00:01:27.761 --> 00:01:28.982
It's teeny-tiny.

28
00:01:29.543 --> 00:01:30.283
Can we go now?

29
00:01:30.303 --> 00:01:32.605
Brad: No, there's one more thing.

30
00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:35.828
Danny: Now what?!

31
00:01:36.468 --> 00:01:39.851
Brad: We have to make sure we can return things to their normal size.

32
00:01:40.712 --> 00:01:42.233
Danny: Why does that matter?

33
00:01:42.254 --> 00:01:45.276
Brad: We don't want to shrink the bullies forever.

34
00:01:45.296 --> 00:01:48.900
Brad: Danny!

35
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.502
You don't want to shrink them forever, do you?

36
00:01:51.522 --> 00:01:53.644
Danny: Why not?

37
00:01:53.985 --> 00:01:55.406
It would teach them a lesson.

38
00:01:55.426 --> 00:01:58.249
Brad: I thought we just wanted to scare them.

39
00:01:58.269 --> 00:02:01.472
Danny: Being tiny forever would scare them!

40
00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:07.639
Brad: Danny, I won't shrink them if we can't restore [n3@them to their normal size.

41
00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:10.261
Danny: Maybe I'll just do it without you.

42
00:02:10.281 --> 00:02:13.083
Brad: It's my dad's nano-putty.

43
00:02:13.764 --> 00:02:15.505
I won't let you use it without me.

44
00:02:15.525 --> 00:02:17.246
Danny: All right!

45
00:02:17.266 --> 00:02:20.629
Brad: It should be a simple adjustment.

46
00:02:21.049 --> 00:02:25.793
Brad: I just need to reverse the stream This should work.

47
00:02:26.753 --> 00:02:28.014
Danny: Well, give it a try.

48
00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:34.001
Danny: Perfect!

49
00:02:34.021 --> 00:02:37.063
Brad: Actually, I don't think it is.

50
00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:39.044
Danny: What do you mean?

51
00:02:39.064 --> 00:02:42.427
Brad: I think it's a bit bigger than it was before.

52
00:02:42.447 --> 00:02:43.888
Danny: Brad!

53
00:02:43.908 --> 00:02:45.529
We can't just keep testing it!

54
00:02:45.609 --> 00:02:49.752
Brad: But I don't think the reversal process is perfect.

55
00:02:49.772 --> 00:02:53.635
Danny: You think the glass is a bit bigger, right?

56
00:02:53.655 --> 00:02:55.076
Brad: Yes.

57
00:02:55.096 --> 00:02:57.718
Danny: But you don't know for sure?

58
00:02:57.738 --> 00:02:59.840
Brad: No.

59
00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.585
Danny: Well, I know one thing for sure.

60
00:03:04.605 --> 00:03:07.732
Danny: I won't be happy until I get those bullies.

61
00:03:07.752 --> 00:03:09.817
Danny: And now we can.

62
00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:11.642
It's time to go.
